'''Crazed Lizard Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by completing the event stage [[Mammals? (Insane)|The Crazed Lizard]] appearing on the '''24th''' and the '''27th''' of every month. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] increases damage and range. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], you can get him from [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Cat Capsules]] after beating [[Cosmic Lounge (Cats of the Cosmos)|Cosmic Club]] in Ch. 3 Interstellar Invasion. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], the stage of where you can obtain this unit appears every '''Thursday'''.

